A couple points:  It is quite possible to kick books or scrolls, with no
ill effects.  (Although how heavy an item you can kick is dependent upon
your character's strength.)  Potions have a *high* chance of shattering
when kicked (which, incidentally, may allow you to identify the potion
via the vapor released).  Also, you won't want to kick eggs or other 
fragile items, because they also will break.

